// M5-A3P-1014. Ch21 H05 "He takes the heart" (C, 1 min). act3_ending.md §2 H05, §0 rule 8. Sefir
// reaches past Dace into Imra's light and begins drawing the heart into himself; Dace holds on. The held motes reverse
// round Sefir, inward and down, the wrong way, faster. FRAMING: Sefir, Dace and Imra share the frame; KERRID IS
// OFF-FRAME in every shot that holds the two lamps. The party's reaction is a reverse looking out from the centre, the
// lamps behind camera. `sefir_warden` breaks into `sefir_heart`.
title: ch21_he_takes_the_heart
location: ch21/heart
---
@letterbox on
@camera HT10
@anim sefir reach_past dace
@vfx glimmer_held at=sefir count=200 drift=down_seaward rate=fast
@wait 3.0
Sefir [neutral]: Let go of her. I can hold her better than you ever could. #line:ch21_heart_001
@wait 2.0
@camera HT11
@anim dace hold imra_light
@wait 3.0
@camera HT12
@music sefir_heart fade=0.0
@wait 2.0
@letterbox off
<<event start_battle ch21_sefir_heart>>
===
